{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Interviewcollectie Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië, interview 1021"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:46363"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Resp_Interviewnummer 1021.1"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië (SMGI)"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Koninklijk Instituut voor Taal-, Land- en Volkenkunde (KITLV)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KITLV  Archives"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KITLV \/ Leiden Universiteit UB"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>De geïnterviewde ging eerst als oorlogsvrijwilliger naar Indië, maar verbleef er uiteindelijk als leraar. Hij vertelt over de guerrilla's waar hij een aantal keer mee te maken kreeg. Hij beschrijft de groeperingen en de misdaden die ze begingen. In 1957 keerde hij terug naar Nederland.<br>Later ging hij voor de zendingsraad naar Nieuw-Guinea. Hij heeft niet veel van de gevechten gemerkt, maar hoorde wel veel verhalen. De geïnterviewde merkte de verdeeldheid bij zijn leerlingen. Hij vertelt over de slechte behandeling van zijn leerlingen door Indonesiërs. De geïnterviewde schetst zijn beeldvorming van de ontwikkelingen na de oorlog.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2011-09-16"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"dekolonisatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"koloniale samenleving"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Japanse bezetting"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Japanse capitulatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Bersiap"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"interneringskampen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KNIL"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nederlands Indië"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Indonesische onafhankelijkheid"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Zendingsraad"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Geloof"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Guerrilla's"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1997-04-18"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Fridus Steijlen (coördinator)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-08-24"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-09-16"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Deze dataset bevat de metadata van de interviewcollectie Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië.<br>Een groep wetenschappers uit verschillende disciplines nam in 1994 het initiatief om de verhalen en ervaringen van mensen, die de turbulente laatkoloniale en vroeg-postkoloniale tijd tussen 1940-1962 in Nederlands-Indië, Indonesië of Nieuw-Guinea hadden meegemaakt, vast te leggen nu het nog kon. Men koos ervoor om geen onderzoeksproject op te zetten, maar om zich te concentreren op het verzamelen van de verhalen van mensen vanuit archiveringsoogpunt als basis voor toekomstig onderzoek. Tussen 1997 en 2001 zijn er 1190 interviews met 724 mensen opgenomen, in totaal 2800 uur aan geluidsmateriaal.<\/p><p>Een overzicht van het project en de interviews in EASY vindt u onder 'Data files'.<\/p><p>De interviews worden bij DANS duurzaam bewaard, maar worden (voorlopig) door het KITLV zelf ontsloten. Zie het veld 'Relations' voor een link naar de collectie op de KITLV-website.<\/p>"}}]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D30000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D30000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Geesteswetenschappen"},{"lang":"en","value":"Humanities"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"History"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Social sciences"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Sociale wetenschappen"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cf8c960a-aa0f-4ee3-a7b0-4a3c847669e6","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-80cb-ed4ca8fa14f3"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cf8c960a-aa0f-4ee3-a7b0-4a3c847669e6","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"},{"@id":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/cfa04ed6-4cd0-4651-80cb-ed4ca8fa14f3","vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections"}]},{"typeName":"dansRelation","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dansRelationType":{"typeName":"dansRelationType","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"relation"},"dansRelationText":{"typeN